{"type":"message","id":"a054cec1","parentId":"1dd324f2","timestamp":"2026-08-02T17:42:07.531Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clash port is responding (400 is expected for a plain HTTP request to a proxy port). But connections through the proxy are timing out - both Binance and Google return 000. This means Clash is running but its outbound nodes are not connected or dead.\n\nLet me check the Clash config and see what nodes are available. The subscription URL is in TOOLS.md: `https://hcbskjd.kunlun01.com/api/kunlun01/215db5e69fbdbaf997df089b13bc69b4`\n\nThe server just came up 2 minutes ago, so Clash might need time to fetch subscriptions and establish connections. Let me check the Clash API for node status and also wait a bit for the subscription to update.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Clash在跑但节点没连上外网。可能是订阅还没刷新完——服务器才刚起来2分钟。让我看看节点状态。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8euljltW0Y9qyKTicfQ49902","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s http://127.0.0.1:9090/proxies 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); proxies=d.get('proxies',{}); groups={k:v for k,v in proxies.items() if v.get('type')=='Selector' or v.get('type')=='URLTest'}; print('=== 代理组 ==='); [print(f'{k}: type={v[\\\"type\\\"]}, now={v.get(\\\"now\\\",\\\"?\\\")}') for k,v in groups.items()]\" 2>&1","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":86,"output":536,"cacheRead":20864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21486,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785692519362}}
