{"type":"message","id":"62c9fd71","parentId":"9e6c6162","timestamp":"2026-08-02T17:42:18.557Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clash is running but the GLOBAL selector is set to DIRECT, meaning it's not routing through any proxy node - it's just doing direct connections, which explains why Binance and Google are timing out (the server probably doesn't have direct internet access to those sites).\n\nAlso, the config seems minimal - only a GLOBAL group and it's set to DIRECT. This suggests the clash config might not have loaded the subscription properly, or the nodes haven't been fetched yet.\n\nLet me wait a bit more and check again - the server just came up 2 minutes ago, the subscription fetch might still be in progress. Or maybe the config is broken and I need to check the clash config file.\n\nLet me look at the clash config.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"GLOBAL指向DIRECT，节点还没加载。可能是刚开机订阅还没拉下来。等一会再查。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_euzxwIyGAnfkfreDuVzH7921","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sleep 10 && curl -s http://127.0.0.1:9090/proxies 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nproxies=d.get('proxies',{})\nprint(f'总代理数: {len(proxies)}')\ngroups={k:v for k,v in proxies.items() if v.get('type') in ('Selector','URLTest','Fallback')}\nfor k,v in groups.items():\n    all_nodes = v.get('all',[])\n    print(f'{k}: type={v[\\\"type\\\"]}, now={v.get(\\\"now\\\",\\\"?\\\")}, nodes={len(all_nodes)}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":108,"output":535,"cacheRead":21248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21891,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785692528038}}
