{"type":"message","id":"c8a8899d","parentId":"d1dad900","timestamp":"2026-08-02T17:45:00.035Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to download this file from Feishu. Let me use the feishu_doc tool to see if this file_key maps to a document, or I need to use the file download API. \n\nActually, the file_key looks like a Feishu file attachment. I don't have a direct \"download file\" tool, but let me try feishu_doc with the file_key. Actually, looking at the available tools, feishu_doc has upload_image and upload_file but not download. \n\nLet me just tell the user what I've found so far about the proxy issue and ask about the file. \n\nActually wait - let me focus on what matters. The proxy is completely down. GLOBAL is set to PROXY but all connections through the proxy fail. This could be:\n1. All nodes are dead\n2. The clash config needs a subscription refresh\n3. Network issue on the server\n\nLet me check if the server has any direct internet access (without proxy).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_6KGAW9fvLqsdHadntOcW0581","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 看看不用代理能不能上网\ncurl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://www.baidu.com -o /dev/null -w \"baidu: %{http_code}\\n\"\ncurl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://httpbin.org/ip -o /dev/null -w \"httpbin: %{http_code}\\n\"\n# 检查 clash 订阅文件\nls -la ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/clash-config.yaml 2>/dev/null && echo \"config exists\" || echo \"no config\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":128,"output":586,"cacheRead":24576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25290,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785692688539}}
