{"type":"message","id":"615fe245","parentId":"96d58ba8","timestamp":"2026-08-02T17:45:30.064Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the server CAN reach the internet directly without proxy. Baidu and httpbin both return 200. The clash proxy is the issue - the nodes are likely dead/expired since the server has been down for 2 days. \n\nThe config file is from May 27. The subscription URL might need to be refreshed. But actually, Clash (Mihomo) should auto-refresh subscriptions periodically. Since the server was down for 2 days, the subscription might not have been refreshed yet.\n\nLet me try to restart Clash to force a subscription refresh, or update the subscription manually. But first let me check if there's a Clash restart mechanism already set up.\n\nActually, let me try a different approach - let me check if the clash API allows me to test proxy delays and see which nodes are alive. Or I could try to update the subscription directly.\n\nLet me look at the clash config to understand the setup better.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不用代理能上网，是Clash节点全挂了。服务器两天没开，节点估计过期了。让我看看配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_xc0k3Wi17L468iMYL4hx5379","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/clash-config.yaml"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":188,"output":464,"cacheRead":24960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25612,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785692708192}}
{"type":"message","id":"2d9299b5","parentId":"615fe245","timestamp":"2026-08-02T17:45:30.142Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_xc0k3Wi17L468iMYL4hx5379","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Clash 配置 - VLESS Reality 多节点 fallback\n# 订阅源（与 /root/配置.md 一致；更新节点时请对照拉取）:\n# https://hcbskjd.kunlun01.com/api/kunlun01/215db5e69fbdbaf997df089b13bc69b4\nmode: rule\nlog-level: info\nallow-lan: false\n\nmixed-port: 7890\nsocks-port: 7891\nhttp-port: 7892\n\ncache-file: \"/root/.config/clash/cache.db\"\n\nexternal-controller: 127.0.0.1:9090\n\ndns:\n  enable: true\n  enhanced-mode: redir-host\n  nameserver:\n    - 223.5.5.5\n    - 8.8.8.8\n    - 1.1.1.1\n\nproxies:\n  # 香港家宽\n  - name: HK-Home-03\n    type: vless\n    server: xg1.kunlun01.com\n    port: 18000\n    uuid: 857aac71-0663-477c-9c11-30010fad752e\n    flow: xtls-rprx-vision\n    network: tcp\n    udp: true\n    tls: true\n    client-fingerprint: firefox\n    reality-opts:\n      public-key: hlRqquCI6AiCSbifwaNIlf_fVoHols95S2A1OG8xnVk\n      short-id: \"\"\n    servername: s0.awsstatic.com\n\n  - name: HK-Home-04\n    type: vless\n    server: xg1.kunlun01.com\n    port: 18000\n    uuid: 857aac71-0663-477c-9c11-30010fad752e\n    flow: xtls-rprx-vision\n    network: tcp\n    udp: true\n    tls: true\n    client-fingerprint: safari\n    reality-opts:\n      public-key: hlRqquCI6AiCSbifwaNIlf_fVoHols95S2A1OG8xnVk\n      short-id: \"\"\n    servername: s0.awsstatic.com\n\n  # 日本东京\n  - name: JP-Tokyo-01\n    type: vless\n    server: rb.kunlun01.com\n    port: 18000\n    uuid: 857aac71-0663-477c-9c11-30010fad752e\n    flow: xtls-rprx-vision\n    network: tcp\n    udp: true\n    tls: true\n    client-fingerprint: qq\n    reality-opts:\n      public-key: hlRqquCI6AiCSbifwaNIlf_fVoHols95S2A1OG8xnVk\n      short-id: \"\"\n    servername: s0.awsstatic.com\n\n  - name: JP-Tokyo-02\n    type: vless\n    server: rb.kunlun01.com\n    port: 18000\n    uuid: 857aac71-0663-477c-9c11-30010fad752e\n    flow: xtls-rprx-vision\n    network: tcp\n    udp: true\n    tls: true\n    client-fingerprint: firefox\n    reality-opts:\n      public-key: hlRqquCI6AiCSbifwaNIlf_fVoHols95S2A1OG8xnVk\n      short-id: \"\"\n    servername: s0.awsstatic.com\n\n  # 韩国家宽\n  - name: KR-Home-01\n    type: vless\n    server: hg.kunlun01.com\n    port: 18000\n    uuid: 857aac71-0663-477c-9c11-30010fad752e\n    flow: xtls-rprx-vision\n    network: tcp\n    udp: true\n    tls: true\n    client-fingerprint: edge\n    reality-opts:\n      public-key: hlRqquCI6AiCSbifwaNIlf_fVoHols95S2A1OG8xnVk\n      short-id: \"\"\n    servername: s0.awsstatic.com\n\n  # 新加坡\n  - name: SG-02\n    type: vless\n    server: xjp0000.kunlun01.com\n    port: 20300\n    uuid: 857aac71-0663-477c-9c11-30010fad752e\n    flow: xtls-rprx-vision\n    network: tcp\n    udp: true\n    tls: true\n    client-fingerprint: firefox\n    reality-opts:\n      public-key: hlRqquCI6AiCSbifwaNIlf_fVoHols95S2A1OG8xnVk\n      short-id: \"\"\n    servername: s0.awsstatic.com\n\nproxy-groups:\n  - name: PROXY\n    type: fallback\n    proxies:\n      - HK-Home-03\n      - HK-Home-04\n      - JP-Tokyo-01\n      - JP-Tokyo-02\n      - KR-Home-01\n      - SG-02\n    url: http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204\n    interval: 30\n    timeout: 5\n\n  - name: CRYPTO-NEWS\n    type: fallback\n    proxies:\n      - JP-Tokyo-01\n      - JP-Tokyo-02\n      - SG-02\n      - KR-Home-01\n    url: https://www.google.com/generate_204\n    interval: 60\n    timeout: 8\n\nrules:\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancefuture.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,api.binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,testnet.binancefuture.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,stream.binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coindesk.com,CRYPTO-NEWS\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coingecko.com,CRYPTO-NEWS\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.deepseek.com,DIRECT\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,feishu.cn,DIRECT\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,larksuite.com,DIRECT\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,larkoffice.com,DIRECT\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,feishucdn.com,DIRECT\n  -