{"type":"message","id":"7ba20306","parentId":"2d9299b5","timestamp":"2026-08-02T17:45:40.556Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the config. The VLESS Reality nodes all use `kunlun01.com` domains. Let me check if these domains are still resolvable from the server:\n\n1. xg1.kunlun01.com (HK)\n2. rb.kunlun01.com (JP)\n3. hg.kunlun01.com (KR)\n4. xjp0000.kunlun01.com (SG)\n\nSince the server can reach the internet directly (baidu and httpbin work), the issue might be that:\n- The kunlun01.com domains are dead/expired\n- The VLESS Reality certs/keys are expired\n- Port 18000/20300 is blocked\n\nLet me test DNS resolution and connectivity. Also, let me check the clash logs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_3ATn2Ic0UGyaYXrqjCwH7857","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 测试节点域名解析和连通性\nfor host in xg1.kunlun01.com rb.kunlun01.com hg.kunlun01.com xjp0000.kunlun01.com; do\n  ip=$(dig +short $host 2>/dev/null | head -1)\n  echo \"$host -> $ip\"\ndone\necho \"---\"\n# 测一下端口\nnc -zv -w3 xg1.kunlun01.com 18000 2>&1 | head -1\necho \"---\"\n# clash 日志\njournalctl -u clash --no-pager -n 10 2>/dev/null || tail -20 /tmp/clash.log 2>/dev/null || echo \"no clash log found\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1631,"output":553,"cacheRead":25344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27528,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785692730145}}
